@startuml 07-seq-realtime
title realtime: SSE replay + WebSocket bus between service and cockpit
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

participant "Cockpit\n(web/src)" as WEB
participant "run-events.ts\nSSE client" as RE
participant "api/ws.ts\nbus client" as WSC
participant "GET /runs/:id/events\nserver.ts:6094" as SSE
participant "GET /api/v1/ws\nws.ts:30" as BUS
participant "RunStore\nruns/store.ts:1153" as STORE

WEB -> RE : open transcript\nnew EventSource(url)
RE -> SSE : GET (with Last-Event-ID / ?afterSeq / ?cursor)
note right of SSE : streamSSENoBuffer: proxy must not\nbuffer the replay burst
SSE -> STORE : streamRunEvents(runs/<id>.ndjson)
SSE --> RE : seq 1..N as id: field\nname "run-event" (v1) / "ui-event" (v2)
SSE -> STORE : onRunEvent(store, id, cb)\nsse-subscriptions.ts:19
note right of SSE : live events arriving DURING replay\nare pushed to `buffered[]`, flushed\nafter the replay tail, only if seq > maxSeq
SSE --> RE : dedup: `if (event.seq <= maxSeq) continue`
SSE --> RE : event "run" (final record) + "ping" every 15_000ms

RE -> RE : coalesceLiveDeltas + seenSeqs set\n(MAX_SEEN_SEQS 10_000, run-events.ts:35)
RE -> RE : RUN_EVENT_BATCH_MS=50 batches frames\n(run-events.ts:32)

WSC -> BUS : WebSocket /api/v1/ws\nverifyWsUpgrade server.ts:8009
WSC -> BUS : {action:"subscribe", topic}
note right of BUS : untrusted (non-loopback) socket is\nrefused topics not flagged\nloopbackReadable (ws.ts:150, default false)
BUS -> BUS : publisher starts on 0->1 subscribers,\nstops on 1->0 (demand-driven)
BUS --> WSC : topic snapshot, then push only on change
BUS --> WSC : ping every HEARTBEAT_MS=30_000\n(ws.ts:36); maxPayload 4_096 (ws.ts:40)

== reconnect ==
RE -> RE : onerror -> EventSource reconnects itself,\nnext GET carries Last-Event-ID
RE -> RE : compaction (retention) failure -> retry\nbase 1_000ms backoff, max 60_000ms\n(run-events.ts:33-34)
WSC -> BUS : on close: RECONNECT_DELAY_MS=3_000\n(ws.ts:29) then re-subscribe held topics
note over WSC,BUS : never `new WebSocket` per feature; one socket\nper cockpit, add a topic instead

@enduml
